@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "IBM Plex Sans"
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFDF8
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #8A7A67
  LifeLineBorderColor #C9B9A2
  ParticipantBorderColor #C9B9A2
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFDF8
  ParticipantFontColor #2B241B
  FontSize 13
  FontColor #2B241B
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FEFFDD
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9B9A2

title retrieve_layer()：一次 next() 推进一层，取数与搬运重叠

participant "调用方\n(vLLM / SGLang)" as C
participant "LMCacheEngine\n.retrieve_layer()" as E
participant "StorageManager\n(异步取数)" as S
participant "GPUConnector\n.batched_to_gpu()" as G

note over E
  **本方法是生成器**
  yield 次数 = num_layers + 1
end note

C -> E : next()
E -> S : layerwise_batched_get() 取第 0 层
E --> C : **yield torch.sum(ret_mask)**
note right
  **只有第 0 层返回掩码**——
  sglang 在这一步就需要知道命中多少
  （注释：since there is no lookup）
end note

loop layer_id = 0 .. num_layers-1
  C -> E : next()
  E -> S : next(get_generator) 取第 layer_id+1 层
  note right: **先发起下一层的取数**
  E --> C : yield None
  note right: **交还控制权**——模型可以继续算下一层
  S --> E : task.result() 第 layer_id 层到手
  E -> G : send(第 layer_id 层对象)
  note right
    **drive 搬运**：把对象送进
    batched_to_gpu 的生成器
  end note
end

E -> E : 对 to_count_down 逐个 ref_count_down()
note right
  **引用不在循环里减**——
  攒到最后统一放，避免搬运中对象被回收
end note
E --> C : yield None（最后一次）
@enduml
